[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0701","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0701.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0902","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1728,\"inputTokens\":9036,\"outputTokens\":17,\"totalTokens\":10781}}","description":"CVE-1999-0902 是 NIS（网络信息服务）服务端程序 ypserv 存在的一个权限控制缺陷。该漏洞的原理是 ypserv 在处理 NIS 密码表（如 passwd）相关操作时，未能对本地用户的操作权限进行严格校验，导致具有本地系统管理员（root 或等效权限）身份的用户可以绕过正常的管理流程，直接修改或篡改 NIS 域内的密码表数据。其影响范围为部署了 ypserv 提供 NIS 服务的类 Unix 系统（如 Solaris、Linux 等使用 NIS 进行集中账号管理的服务器），攻击条件要求攻击者已获得目标主机的本地管理员权限，利用方式是本地管理员借助该缺陷直接读写 NIS 密码映射表，从而可伪造或重置其他用户的凭据，破坏账号系统的完整性与安全性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0902"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:17Z","remediation":"建议升级到包含修复的 ypserv 新版本（如 2.3 及以上，随系统发行版安全更新发布）。在无法立即升级时，限制 ypserv 守护进程仅监听受信任的内部网络接口，通过防火墙规则（如 iptables）禁止非授权主机访问 111 端口及 NIS 端口范围，并收紧本地管理员权限、启用 NIS 主从同步校验以降低被篡改密码表的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0902","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4911ecf62ee3ece187fa403d342ac371a208a06f/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0902.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0902","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0902.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e28f1b2cbe9256d47132558d422c401a0de0ac99/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0902.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a19aba8d63d33f084c63def59eb8feb23a95b044/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r774-h43h-88gg/GHSA-r774-h43h-88gg.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0902.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/c677135c5a44ecff201a46de647ea5bfab7c1598/osv/AZL-7456.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/1999/19991027.data","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4dd129e1-1deb-4829-a342-fdffb82aeae6.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0701.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0699","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0699.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0901","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9101,\"outputTokens\":17,\"totalTokens\":10782}}","description":"ypserv（NIS 网络信息服务服务器端程序）存在访问控制缺陷，本地已认证用户可绕过权限检查，直接修改其他用户的 GECOS 字段（用户描述信息）及登录 Shell。该漏洞影响运行 ypserv 的 NIS 域环境，攻击前提是攻击者在目标系统上拥有合法本地账户。利用方式上，本地用户通过调用相关 NIS 服务接口即可篡改其他账号信息，进而可能提升权限或实施进一步入侵，CVSS 评分为 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0901"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:17Z","remediation":"升级 ypserv 至已修复版本（NIS 服务软件包最新版），并正确配置 /var/yp/securenets 文件限制可访问的客户端网段。同时启用 ypserv 访问控制，仅允许受信任主机绑定 NIS 域；对无需 NIS 的主机应停用并卸载 ypserv 服务，加固本地用户对 GECOS 及登录 shell 的修改权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0901","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/cf29b986be3ae7c9144123b101d864868676099e/1999/CVE-1999-0901.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4911ecf62ee3ece187fa403d342ac371a208a06f/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0901.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0901","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e28f1b2cbe9256d47132558d422c401a0de0ac99/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0901.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0901.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a19aba8d63d33f084c63def59eb8feb23a95b044/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f3vg-8384-p37m/GHSA-f3vg-8384-p37m.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0901.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0699.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0698","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0698.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0900","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9117,\"outputTokens\":24,\"totalTokens\":10805}}","description":"rpc.yppasswdd（NIS 口令更新守护进程）在处理口令修改请求时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该进程在生成 MD5 哈希的过程中未对用户输入的长度进行边界校验，导致本地用户可通过构造超长的输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，进而覆盖相邻内存并篡改执行流程，最终以 root 权限执行任意指令实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响运行 NIS/yp 服务且启用了 rpc.yppasswdd 的 Unix/Linux 系统，攻击者需具备目标系统的本地登录权限方可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级为高危。修复建议升级至已修补的相关系统版本或停止不必要的 rpc.yppasswdd 服务。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0900"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:17Z","remediation":"建议升级 rpc.yppasswdd（NIS/yp-tools 或 ypserv 软件包）到厂商发布的已修复版本，例如通过操作系统包管理器执行 apt-get update && apt-get upgrade ypserv 或 yum update ypserv 安装最新补丁。如无法立即升级，应停用 yppasswdd 服务（关闭 rpc.yppasswdd 守护进程）并限制对 NIS 端口的本地访问，避免本地用户利用 MD5 哈希生成触发缓冲区溢出提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0900","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4911ecf62ee3ece187fa403d342ac371a208a06f/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0900.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0900","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0900.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e28f1b2cbe9256d47132558d422c401a0de0ac99/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0900.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a19aba8d63d33f084c63def59eb8feb23a95b044/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hw9r-5hfp-j23w/GHSA-hw9r-5hfp-j23w.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0900.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83043/info.html","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/1999/19991027.data","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a044a934-29dc-4652-a72c-0ff2c6ac9a47.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0698.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1409","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1409.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0951","title":"Omnicron OmniHTTPd Pro 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Omnicron OmniHTTPd 1.1 及 2.4 Pro 版本的 CGI 程序 imagemap.exe 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标 Web 服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而在服务器上以 Web 进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 OmniHTTPd 1.1 和 2.4 Pro 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0951"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-10-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:23Z","remediation":"OmniHTTPd 1.1/2.4 Pro 已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议立即停止使用该软件并迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache、Nginx、IIS）。如无法立即替换，应将服务器置于独立防火墙后，严格限制外部对 CGI 程序 imagemap.exe 的访问，并移除或重命名该 CGI 文件以阻断利用路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/3380","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/739","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19566","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58316128f65d22a226717ff1f92ebf2058e46bc6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0951.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0951","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-0951.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4d2ed764072119c12b6f84e6ee4e0df62586a8c4/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0951.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/95e6ff620d5494b93ba2234edfcf6a45187dc0a8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wrpp-w6hr-5mrv/GHSA-wrpp-w6hr-5mrv.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/mtesauro/owasp-wte/blob/e4c016caf67d59634f309f2a1feeed7dc9515abe/temp-projects/spikeproxy/contents/opt/owasp/spikeproxy/scan_database.db","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/imagemap.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0951.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1409.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1409.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1409.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1057","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1057.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1341","title":"Linux Kernel SLIP/PPP 本地IP数据包伪造漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.3.18 之前版本及 2.2.13pre15 之前版本中，启用了 SLIP 和 PPP 选项时存在数据伪造漏洞。本地低权限用户可通过向 tty 设备发送 TIOCSETD 选项来伪造 IP 数据包，实现网络身份冒用或数据欺骗，破坏网络层通信完整性。该漏洞影响早期 Linux 内核发行版。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1341"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:14Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.13pre15 及以上版本（2.2.x 系列）或 2.3.18 及以上版本（2.3.x 系列），新版本已禁用未授权用户通过 TIOCSETD 选项操作 tty 设备，防止本地用户伪造 IP 数据包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94061108411308&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7858","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50269681ee58c9b5bf7169b73546eef94697389c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1341.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1341","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1341.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1341.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-93vw-vqx6-c3wr/GHSA-93vw-vqx6-c3wr.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1341.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000830.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--42bb9866-9451-4da8-87d3-7a2c62066b98.json","https://github.com/shamedgh/confine/blob/a75dad3ad336e6258a42cd1ce4af061eea68ed76/cve.files/cveToFile.json.type.csv","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1057.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0704","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0704.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0905","title":"Axent Raptor Firewall 6.0 IP选项零长度处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Axent Raptor Firewall 6.0 存在 IP 选项零长度拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向受影响的防火墙系统发送特制的零长度 IP 选项数据包，导致防火墙服务崩溃或无法响应正常请求。该漏洞影响 Axent Raptor Firewall 6.0 版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程触发，危害等级中危。厂商已发布安全更新修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0905"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-10-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:18Z","remediation":"升级 Axent Raptor Firewall 至 6.0 以上版本，或安装厂商发布的安全补丁。如无法升级，可在防火墙配置中启用 IP 选项过滤规则，丢弃包含零长度 IP 选项的异常数据包。考虑到 Axent 已被 Symantec 收购且产品已停止维护，建议迁移至仍在安全支持周期内的替代防火墙产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1121","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/736","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19564","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d25d3aeab9dc76030f155f9e202a4a7c294f86bf/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0905.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0905","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0905.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03324c0426abad4e55ae7c73b0bba67b9c87e4ea/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0905.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/799c403529fad0f67d5473eea397e9968232a5ec/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5mcc-m9mr-95rg/GHSA-5mcc-m9mr-95rg.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e