s":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1117","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/725","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=19991020150002.21047.qmail%40tarjan.mediaways.net","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b9fb833e196fd08d699d3ef970b517d24cc12600/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0895.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0895","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0895.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1eab609178bfac1fdc1fdc37b8b4d17d9ecf98b7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0895.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/799c403529fad0f67d5473eea397e9968232a5ec/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x9jx-4f5p-w3jp/GHSA-x9jx-4f5p-w3jp.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0895.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--70aa4d1a-1549-4b87-9bdc-cceb9e246b5a.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/ec3be0baed1eb129c466b944014a0769e187fd54/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0691.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0897","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0897.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1047","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":10789,\"outputTokens\":18,\"totalTokens\":10807}}","description":"Gauntlet 5.0 BSDI 防火墙在按照特定顺序安装 BSDI 官方补丁时，补丁间的依赖关系和加载顺序存在缺陷，导致远程攻击者能够利用该顺序缺陷绕过防火墙预设的访问控制规则，访问原本被拦截的网络资源或服务。由于该绕过行为不会被系统日志记录，安全审计人员无法通过日志追踪相关攻击活动，造成安全防护盲区。该漏洞影响 Gauntlet 5.0 BSDI 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级较高。建议管理员按照官方推荐顺序安装补丁并复核防火墙规则配置，以消除安全绕过风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1047"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:35Z","remediation":"正确安装补丁顺序：先安装 BSDI 补丁 M310-049，再安装 Gauntlet 5.0，最后重新编译并重启内核；或联系 NAI/TIS 获取官方修复补丁。临时缓解措施：以 root 身份将 /usr/local/sys.gauntlet/i386/OBJ/ip_input.o 复制到 /usr/src/sys/i386/OBJ，执行 /usr/local/sys.gauntlet/build_kernel/build_kernel 50.1 重新编译内核后重启系统，防止防火墙访问规则被绕过且无日志记录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94026690521279&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94036662326185&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/3397.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/533781dad27f942aff722a3a8d5992d7df86d126/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1047.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1047","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1047.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a31d2f5a71538913547927468112ac9591961ea3/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1047.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6da213119b3c54637329347c0dc42c66b8a84f0a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hf63-g73x-xwcf/GHSA-hf63-g73x-xwcf.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1047.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58