0.5 userOsa 符号链接漏洞","description":"SCO OpenServer 5.0.5 中的 userOsa 程序存在符号链接漏洞，本地攻击者可通过创建恶意符号链接欺骗程序写入或覆盖任意文件，导致文件损坏或权限提升。该漏洞影响 SCO OpenServer 5.0.5 版本，攻击者需具备本地用户权限，利用 userOsa 程序处理符号链接时的竞争条件，将符号链接指向敏感系统文件，诱导程序写入恶意数据导致文件损坏或权限提升。CVSS 评分 2.1，属于本地权限提升类低危漏洞，SCO 已发布补丁修复该符号链接竞争条件漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0893"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:16Z","remediation":"升级 SCO OpenServer 至 5.0.6 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可移除 userOsa 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/userOsa）或限制可执行该程序的用户组，以阻断符号链接攻击路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0893","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19542","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/cf29b986be3ae7c9144123b101d864868676099e/1999/CVE-1999-0893.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8d0ba8eaeba3ff3558e6044a19d5b454dcc12f33/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0893.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0893","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/512c773c61886081b2589de76a8cfde795349819/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0893.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0893.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3c5965e4a3ad0d0b437f880f71224c9e3d8d5fd5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cqqq-8j4q-wwrq/GHSA-cqqq-8j4q-wwrq.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0893.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict